e": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> If clause  - Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Main clause \u2013 Result</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If + Simple present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple present\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<i>If you<span class=\"strong\"> develop</span> software, you <span class=\"strong\">need</span> a source code editor.</i>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<i>If you<span class=\"strong\"> run</span> a debugger, it <span class=\"strong\">finds</span> mistakes in the code.</i>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Words related to Programming tools"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">A programming tool is a computer program used by software developers to create, debug, maintain, or support other programs to accomplish specific tasks.</div><br />  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Source Code Editor</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is a text editor program, It offers several features such as syntax highlighting, indentation, autocomplete and bracket matching functionality.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Compiler</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is a computer program that allows the main program to run into another computer program. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interpreter</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is a computer program that directly performs, instructions written in a programming or scripting language. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Debugger</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is a computer program that is used to test and debug the \\\"target\\\" program. Some debuggers offer two modes of operation\u2014full or partial simulation\u2014to limit this impact.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Profiler</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is a program analysis that measures, the space, memory, the usage of particular instructions, or the frequency and duration of function calls. Profiler information serves to help program optimization.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chunk"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "informal word to refer to a part of something, especially a large part"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to include three main chunks of information."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "debug"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to remove mistakes from a computer program"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A programming tool is a computer program used by software developers to create, debug, maintain, or support other programs to accomplish specific tasks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "assembler"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a program that changes computer instructions into machine code using a set of numbers to give instructions to a computer"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The programming tools list is wide; for example, a debugger, Compilers, profilers linkers, assemblers, disassemblers, load testers, and performance analysts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sub- navigation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "internal options for moving around a website or computer screen, or between websites or screens. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to design sub-navigation in your wik "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Tracking system"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set of computer equipment and programs used together for examining marks or pieces of information that show where the information is."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bug databases are tracking systems, and it keeps track of software bugs reported "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "permanently"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "always"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It talks about source code editor, compiler, or interpreter as basic tools which software developers use permanently."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about programming tools. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Identify the main programming tools. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph about how to work the main programming tools. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your paragraph to your classmates and instructor."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify the main programming tools. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short paragraph about how to work the main programming tools and I show my paragraph to my classmates and instructor."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n3le02ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"> <span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span>  Hey, Karl. I need to create a wiki about programing tools, but I'm not familiar with it. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karl: </span> I have a good book I used in college. If we look at it, we can use it as a reference. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Martin: </span> If I design the web layout, all the information is available; and, If we create a friendly website, many employees take advantage of this information. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Karl: </span> We need to include three main chunks of information. First, the concept, then a list of programming tools, and we can add a section of examples of how they work. </div><br />"}, {"time": "34000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"> <span class=\"strong\">Martin: </span>  We should start with the concept; you can say a programming tool is a computer program used by software developers to create, debug, maintain, or support other programs to accomplish specific tasks. As a software developer, if I want to create new software, I use programming tools. </br><span class=\"strong\">Karl: </span> There is a science and technology article that lists a group of programming tools; it talks about source code editor, compiler, or interpreter as basic tools which software developers use permanently. Also, memory debugger is used by C++ as a programming tool to create a memory management and optimize memory efficiency. </br><span class=\"strong\">Martin: </span> If employees also know Dmalloc, Electric Fence, Insure++, Valgrind, we can include them in our wiki; these are examples of tools. </div><br/>"}, {"time": "90000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"> <span class=\"strong\">Karl: </span> What about Bug databases?<div align=\"justify\"> <span class=\"strong\"> </span>They are programming tools, right?  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Martin: </span> Yes, that is how each tool works. Bug databases are tracking systems, and it keeps track of software bugs reported; it's a type of issue tracking system. The programming tools list is wide. If you want to include them all, you have to design sub-navigation in your wiki; for example, a debugger, compilers, profilers' linkers, assemblers, disassemblers, load testers, and performance analysts. But for now, let's get to work! </div><br/>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n3le02ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can list a group of programming tools."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explain the concept of programming tools. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can give examples of how programming tools work."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What programming tools do you know about?\t"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What programming tools would you recommend to remove mistakes from a code? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left